/E (Standalone code samples:  Include snippets of code that show your programming skills. Focus on demonstrating clean and well-structured code, adherence to coding standards, and problem-solving approaches. Be sure to include comments in the code to provide context and explain your thought process. These code samples don't need to be part of a complete project but should demonstrate your knowledge or ability in a specified area, including how the code interacts with other systems in the application.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
endobj
