/Pg 34 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
848 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Networking and multiplayer functionality: Develop a project that demonstrates your understanding of networking and multiplayer functionality. This could be a simple multiplayer game or an application that relies on real-time collaboration.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [4]
>>
